          "title": "You'll want to know: દુકાળ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "દુકાળ — dukāḷ — \"drought, famine\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "આ વરસે દુકાળ પડશે. — ā varase dukāḷ paḍśe — \"There will be a drought this year.\""
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "દુકાળ (dukāḷ) is a tadbhava. It comes from Sanskrit duṣkāla, \"evil time\", built from duṣ-, \"bad\", and kāla, \"time\"; CDIAL glosses the Gujarati word \"famine\" (CDIAL 6470)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for everyday life at A2."
